Determine whether phenomenal unity is best represented as:

* an equivalence relation;
* a graph;
* a hypergraph;
* a hierarchy;
* a sheaf of local fields;
* or a temporally evolving family of overlapping domains.

The key empirical material is:

* split-brain phenomena;
* dissociative neurological conditions;
* binocular rivalry;
* divided attention;
* anaesthesia transitions;
